config SND_MQENGINE
	tristate "Opcode MIDIEngine 2Port/SE on a parallel port"
	depends on HAS_IOPORT
	select SND_RAWMIDI
	help
	  To use an Opcode MIDIEngine 2Port/SE, a Music Quest design,
	  connected to the parallel port, say Y here and keep the port's
	  own driver off it: this takes the port itself. Its two inputs
	  and two outputs appear as one rawmidi device.

	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the module
	  will be called snd-mqengine.
